WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.510
- So wait, what's the worst
vacation you've been on?

00:00:03.510 --> 00:00:04.560
- Oh, God.

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:06.030
Yeah, I have some terrible ones of those.

00:00:06.030 --> 00:00:06.863
- You do?

00:00:06.863 --> 00:00:09.030
- Yeah, I think the worst one I got,

00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:10.890
I was, you know, in my mid-twenties

00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:13.800
and I was backpacking around,
and my sandals that I had

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:18.060
kind of disintegrated, but
I wanted to be barefoot.

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:20.280
I thought I was kinda a
real hardcore traveler.

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:22.200
Anyway, I picked something up in my foot,

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:25.050
which was a small parasitic worm.

00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:27.810
And months later, it
takes a while to just,

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:28.740
you know, just stay.

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:31.380
And months later, I felt these track marks

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:32.499
coming up my ankle.

00:00:32.499 --> 00:00:33.870
(squeals)

00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:34.703
- [Kelly] Oh no, oh no.

00:00:34.703 --> 00:00:35.536
- They would blister, and I wasn't sure

00:00:35.536 --> 00:00:37.200
what it was, so I went to the doctors.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:38.880
You know, the local doctor,
they didn't know what it was.

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:41.100
I went into London to the
tropical medicine department,

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:41.978
they didn't know what it was.

00:00:41.978 --> 00:00:42.811
- Are they in your skin?

00:00:42.811 --> 00:00:43.644
- They're in my skin.

00:00:43.644 --> 00:00:46.353
- Oh God, Oh God, Oh God, Oh God.

00:00:47.670 --> 00:00:48.503
- Yeah.

00:00:48.503 --> 00:00:49.830
- Wait, that's so gross.

00:00:49.830 --> 00:00:52.860
- And in the day, they're dormant, right?

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:54.450
But at night is when they're active.

00:00:54.450 --> 00:00:56.910
So you'd be asleep, and then you'd wake up

00:00:56.910 --> 00:01:00.990
and you'd feel something
tracking up your leg, literally.

00:01:00.990 --> 00:01:03.270
I remember running down and
going and getting some cutlery

00:01:03.270 --> 00:01:05.610
and being like, "Yeah,
yeah," trying to cut it out.

00:01:05.610 --> 00:01:07.437
But, you know, you can't just cut it out.

00:01:07.437 --> 00:01:09.000
You have to take drugs for it.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:11.981
- Oh my God. Oh, I would be so drugged up.

00:01:11.981 --> 00:01:12.814
(audience and guests laugh)

